{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1032_p", "source_sha256": "52353cf02d15228dcf92f2ef424655fa6851dccf815a7283f29c27ade63d2d96", "ja": "うん、そういう意味じゃないな……のり子が言ったのは\nステージ裏、普段の努力の部分なのかもしれない。", "zh": "嗯，应该不是这个意思……\n法子说的可能是下舞台后，平常努力的部分吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1033_p", "source_sha256": "3a924246f16e4ec7ebcf131832fbb807769fe82e92adfa38f4ce947673c8a5b5", "ja": "それに個人の魅力は、\nただ真似をすれば出せるというものじゃないしな。", "zh": "而且个人魅力\n也不是光靠模仿就能散发出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1034_047sub", "source_sha256": "1cb2aa853dafc37c835cdea4611772502800700d993d16189d6c2b3a5cfa97af", "ja": "おお……さすが{$P$}だぜ。だよな、\nオレの公演なのに、杏奈みたいだったらおかしいよな。", "zh": "喔喔……真不愧是{$P$}啊。\n的确没错，明明是我的公演却学杏奈那套，会很怪吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1035_p", "source_sha256": "32042167bcbc929e4ea1134fd66b10fb6e83ed7fa24e8339038bc700f93b8a52", "ja": "ああ。だから昴は昴の魅力、昴ならではの\n可愛いを見つけて欲しいと思う。", "zh": "没错，所以我希望昴可以找出自己的魅力，\n找出专属于你的可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1036_047sub", "source_sha256": "f9a36c8466c39cb25dbcb8d9456d0189f14c007b3f7ebebb8ea506de7c13fa4a", "ja": "オレならでは、か～。ムズいけど、がんばるよ！\nなぁ、美也はどうだ？　美也は何がかわいいと思う？", "zh": "专属于我啊～虽然很难，但我会努力的！\n话说美也你呢？你觉得什么可爱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1037_042miy", "source_sha256": "49a9110c1f12883d0bb7ac6b7295a6eeb9566c4f3337b25e7b4a33e8b7f8b4d7", "ja": "そうですね～。ニコニコしている人は、\nとってもかわいいと思います～。", "zh": "这个嘛～\n我觉得笑咪咪的人非常可爱～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1038_p", "source_sha256": "a810900645a0f60bccd81cbcc1af2e0f26b12e2d503bb2e3666c488068b1ca9e", "ja": "ニコニコしている人か。うん、そうだな。\n笑顔は、可愛いへの近道かもしれない。", "zh": "笑咪咪的人吗？嗯，没错。\n也许笑容正是通往可爱的捷径。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1039_042miy", "source_sha256": "d7f78c8437ccc6151d16315d77356eb9ceb67271be33d4f461e34baee1e619dd", "ja": "はい～。なので、今の{$P$}さんも、\nとってもかわいいと思いますよ～。", "zh": "是的～所以我觉得现在的{$P$}先生\n也非常可爱喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1040_p", "source_sha256": "b39619ca3bd814ad3d346467cc99285847f1409442bc94b2f54f2d8118c8b907", "ja": "え、俺……？\nいや、俺の事は置いといて……。", "zh": "咦？我……？\n不，先不讨论我了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "3b781218db3114686e44d16a5e30cb01183df52099636427dd88ebc0f3c1a402", "ja": "笑顔か……それなら、オレにもできるかも？\n美也の言ってることは、クリアできそうだな！", "zh": "笑容啊……那我或许也做得到喔？\n美也说的这项我应该能达成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1042_042miy", "source_sha256": "582a6191d7b930daa0456c1cec4bf5b201052ca21c31b3ac48ab98b78263e9e0", "ja": "おお～、良かったです～。", "zh": "喔喔～真是太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1043_047sub", "source_sha256": "b85135ada544c7a8b753e8da182b5fe9f0ce9cf4057953b996b722a8c5273a5d", "ja": "あ、千鶴は？\n千鶴も教えてくれよ！", "zh": "啊，千鹤呢？\n千鹤也说说看嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1044_038chz", "source_sha256": "0af188e430cc44b32c9874ad10e1bc9b77f9aab854d029dd146336997be25db5", "ja": "そうですわね。昴らしい真っ直ぐなかわいらしさ……\nそして、のり子の言ったギャップ……。", "zh": "这个嘛，昴独有的直率可爱……\n加上法子说的反差……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1045_038chz", "source_sha256": "a66a7d365faaac9d74c4a914d3109419b33b00e83f4943d1687583a243711fc1", "ja": "たとえて言うなら、無邪気な中にも\n凛とした強さがあるような……。", "zh": "要比喻的话，\n就像在天真无邪中带有凛然的坚强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1046_038chz", "source_sha256": "edf078c9171b1ced0986beaf4ce9667c930f7e5c4d79da8e96b9957c476b43bc", "ja": "ハッ！？　わ、わかりましたわ！\nつまり、昴に必要なのは……高貴ですわ！", "zh": "啊！？本、本小姐懂了！\n也就是说，昴需要的……就是高贵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1047_047sub", "source_sha256": "8565ab45ebca3bdebe2d12472258c1a321d6d2f94324d229037123b6322df968", "ja": "ええっ！？　こ、高貴って、セレブってこと？\nオレが！？", "zh": "咦咦！？高、高贵是指像名流一样？\n我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1048_038chz", "source_sha256": "7169d92f41f7cdb68da995af7beb1df5d25bbfabf433e958c9c82d08f3a6e31e", "ja": "ええ。素直で、真っ直ぐなかわいらしさのある昴。\nそこに高貴さが加われば、最早無敵ですわ！", "zh": "没错，昴很坦率，有着直率的可爱，\n如果再加入一些高贵气质，肯定就所向无敌了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1049_047sub", "source_sha256": "99cbd59b0b6be702437c696e72135f0e81229bb12d2ed9a8f07a886def6b9db1", "ja": "マジか……！\nでもセレブって、難しそうだなぁ。", "zh": "真的假的……！\n但是扮演名流听起来好困难啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1050_038chz", "source_sha256": "a4cd75e92d1e9af881873b2def6cb00226a4b43ca8b745d37e38563e2a59dc18", "ja": "あら、そんなことありませんわ。現にわたくしも……\nゲホッゴホッ！　な、なんでもありませんわ！？", "zh": "哎呀，其实不会喔，本小姐就是一个例……\n咳、咳！本、本小姐没说什么喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1051_043nor", "source_sha256": "e30728cd73affaf1b94fad16c0c584fffc34c20a70f4e974ce1750b2fece95bd", "ja": "あ、でもさ。千鶴さんも今言ってたけど……\n昴って、今でも十分かわいいよね？", "zh": "啊，但就像千鹤姊说的……\n其实昴现在就已经很可爱了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1052_047sub", "source_sha256": "9c268d03053848a97f4677495104f1c84e65a40cbac6143a4fd2446f12a63977", "ja": "はあっ？　な、何言ってんだよ、のり子！\nオレがかわいいとか、そんなのあるわけないって！", "zh": "啥？法、法子，你在说什么啊！？\n我看起来哪里可爱了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1053_047sub", "source_sha256": "428c5af643dfc118eb5ff3869742b179592222c56ca9bde24bc0564da420328d", "ja": "でも、なんでだろうなー？　オレもアイドルなのに、\n全然かわいくないのって……あっ！？", "zh": "但这是为什么呢──？我明明也是偶像，\n却一点都不可爱……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1054_025roc", "source_sha256": "fb26a9557589ed41ca5b68b635b2059876354972001085e2b6b2cb2870ce5012", "ja": "スバル？", "zh": "昴？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1055_047sub", "source_sha256": "93b9d24df6414d119d9c2ec3a19bf9dce59bc2d747540f860cdc437d94f00fdf", "ja": "そうか、わかったよ{$P$}！\nオレ、言葉遣いがあんまり女子っぽくないからだ！", "zh": "对了，我知道了，{$P$}！\n因为我讲话的方式不太像女孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1056_047sub", "source_sha256": "7d1b220ccd51661fec316ed8df96039a310055296427df1fcb592624a162edd7", "ja": "だから、オレが喋り方を変えたら、\nかわいい感じになるかも！", "zh": "所以要是我换个方式说话，\n也许就会变可爱了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1057_p", "source_sha256": "609e3179023dd698d0eddd18b1caf74d177a2e799f8832729d61c7eb0866280c", "ja": "ええっ？", "zh": "咦咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1058_042miy", "source_sha256": "5a7692e5e165ae64ef9f9b9713603311af9acde64e0cc026b03ca41c6b04e869", "ja": "む～ん、そうでしょうか……？　昴ちゃんは、\n今のままでもかわいいと私は思いますけど……？", "zh": "唔～是这样吗……？\n我觉得小昴现在就已经很可爱了耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1059_038chz", "source_sha256": "2e7d1b706efb1dd10681db6f7b855bc9478efbc7fd72d211e1212bfbf4386024", "ja": "そうですわ、昴。そんなふうに、無理に自分を\n変えようとしなくてもいいのではありませんか？", "zh": "没错，昴。\n你应该不需要勉强自己做什么改变吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1060_047sub", "source_sha256": "4752b6a65470a0046ee41b4372a2df0c7cfad6e42180fc3c0be68901cb821492", "ja": "みんな……へへっ、サンキュな！\nでもオレ、やるって決めたんだ！", "zh": "大家……嘿嘿，谢啦！\n但我已经下定决心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1061_047sub", "source_sha256": "036708428d4a66fd2baf443a71b225881e8ef7c9f7a9523150464824d8db6950", "ja": "今回のライブ、オレは絶対かわいくなって成功させる！\n……じゃなくて、私、かわいくなって成功させますわ！", "zh": "我一定要变可爱，让这次的演唱会圆满落幕！\n……不对，是人家一定要变可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1062_043nor", "source_sha256": "3a9e7b8c989747cc766c7d6ccb6dc33207fae1fb805387f5f74ea3bad849ac78", "ja": "昴……！", "zh": "昴……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1063_p", "source_sha256": "98fae607204ffd11f5ea1a0ecdc8a7a7840c4e2dafcabfebf87231b6658a9cb0", "ja": "昴……。", "zh": "昴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1064_047sub", "source_sha256": "a9494e7fcdbca74f9a8e6964697514cf91afd55127e0bd9b2e3ae99d8b2f6cee", "ja": "なんだよ、{$P$}、その顔！", "zh": "{$P$}，你那表情是什么意思啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1065_047sub", "source_sha256": "49e99d054de1f631d3b418b7f2c850b7406161ef13053792faa68cb445018153", "ja": "{$P$}は、オレの気持ち……わ、私の\n乙女心？をわかってくれないのね！　絶交しますわよ！", "zh": "{$P$}一点也不懂我……\n不、不懂人家的少女心呢！人家要跟你绝交！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1066_p", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1067_043nor", "source_sha256": "ad18a6f367cb3056a934c9a85d34195e6c8014580e8b8c9dd84dfc86e7bcd935", "ja": "だよねー。{$P$}、\nちょっとデリカシーが足りないんじゃない？", "zh": "就是说嘛～{$P$}，\n你神经有点太大条了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1068_038chz", "source_sha256": "6b3d76cee6ff5657522dba08370b3b818d8e2f5f125616f0a46fd1a683b93afc", "ja": "そうですわ、{$P$}！　昴なりに\n努力しているのですから、認めてあげてくださいまし！", "zh": "说得没错，{$P$}！\n昴也是用自己的方式在努力，你就认可她吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1069_p", "source_sha256": "43dc687448b5a8172b01b085810f6f7fb1b95d528ca7e8d7eb054e7a6f9cd2a5", "ja": "のり子……ち、千鶴さんまで……\nいや、昴が努力している事はわかりますけど。", "zh": "法子……连、连千鹤都这样……\n不，我是看得出来昴很努力啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1070_p", "source_sha256": "70a27c433ef8cdde99660911c47cf906cdf6c3ac1662ec5fb2bae68a6e29a06b", "ja": "さっき、のり子も言ってたとおり、無理に何かを\n変えたりしなくても、昴は可愛いと思うんです。", "zh": "就像法子刚刚说的一样，\n用不着勉强自己改变，昴就已经很可爱了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1072_p", "source_sha256": "086e78b2c90556e2e6960d38033ef3c3198a31ad9d45e6dbb6ec0e461338e40e", "ja": "だから……何はともあれ、レッスンだ！\nレッスンの中で、ゆっくり答えを見つけていこう！", "zh": "所以……无论如何，先训练就对了！\n在训练中慢慢找出答案吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1073_047sub", "source_sha256": "20bec502ac59d13faae5e39a41121b3532ba9c7b455e8cc1f1d53e2cf2aa4e7f", "ja": "うーん……ま、それもそっか。\nよし、やるぞ！　……じゃない、やりますわよ！", "zh": "嗯……好吧，也对啦。\n那我要加油啦……不对，人家可要加油了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1074_p", "source_sha256": "e6396711c7b9c065d8bf05cc9e98bd2d3525bef52487b0b0f684770a25e6c3fe", "ja": "それはまだ続けるのか……。", "zh": "还要继续这样讲话吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1075_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1076_p", "source_sha256": "0d492dbcd919aa5e73a3cde71c2b0b9717136cc204d8f501f182d1501bbef7d4", "ja": "（ついに本番当日。レッスン、もとい\n昴の可愛い修行も順調のようだし、このままなら……）", "zh": "（终于来到正式表演当天，训练……不，\n昴的可爱修行似乎也很顺利，这样的话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1077_047sub", "source_sha256": "f9812c57fde1924d675c78a0f8c65e7b112b974f34035555168ea09ef9748198", "ja": "{$P$}！　オレ……じゃなくて、私！\nえっと……うわーっ！　もうダメだ、どうしよう！！", "zh": "{$P$}！我……不对，人家！\n呃……呜哇──！不行了，该怎么办！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1078_p", "source_sha256": "e38f5cb611bb82eb8423240dcd8c055093c051482f97dec56b9d018d2dc90adf", "ja": "昴？　どうしたんだ、そんなに慌てて……。\n何かあったのか？", "zh": "昴？你怎么慌张成这样……\n发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1079_047sub", "source_sha256": "db43b97a5dc9fcd47709a034ffa24dc28d6066229aa54b59ef1ec6b9d4301921", "ja": "オレ、なんか女の子っぽい喋り方とかいろいろ\n練習したのに！　緊張で、全部忘れちゃったよー！", "zh": "我明明练了很多女孩子的说话方式！\n但一紧张就忘光光了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1080_p", "source_sha256": "609e3179023dd698d0eddd18b1caf74d177a2e799f8832729d61c7eb0866280c", "ja": "ええっ？", "zh": "咦咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1081_047sub", "source_sha256": "6f4d4ffe941155944107c2ca84bdb32659c2993652bfaa59675a36236ccddeba", "ja": "どうしよう、{$P$}！\nこのままじゃオレ、失敗しちゃう……！", "zh": "怎么办，{$P$}！\n这样下去我会搞砸的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1082_p", "source_sha256": "07496028e9c64d41229024ec2c652871fe84fab1788f00c4081ea9400f163c39", "ja": "昴……忘れちゃったなら、それでいいんだ。\n今の昴の、ありのままでステージに立とう！", "zh": "昴……既然忘记就算了吧，\n以你现在最自然的模样站上舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1083_047sub", "source_sha256": "89c8fdfda4d85629a08719d87656a2b5c29463188b3d561035d4487719facaa2", "ja": "ええっ！？　で、でもそんなんじゃオレ、\nみんなにかわいいって思ってもらえないじゃん！", "zh": "咦咦！？但、但这样的话，\n大家就不会觉得我可爱了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1084_p", "source_sha256": "daa8884498059c78fb55ee695976098f8d55ba6c2f4bc164daec7f8592cf3c59", "ja": "何度も言ってるけど、昴は可愛いんだ。\n色々練習して身についた事で、更に可愛くなった。", "zh": "我已经说好多次了，你很可爱。\n经历各种练习、有所进步之后，又变得更可爱了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1085_047sub", "source_sha256": "4c180916f7ed7f90d6639ad6ba97618eaa03a5480239d4b660c8a2371b88a247", "ja": "うわー！　なんか、そう言われるとハズい！\nそれに、忘れちゃったんだから身についてないじゃん！", "zh": "呜哇──！听你这样说很害羞耶！\n而且既然忘了，不就代表没有进步吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1086_p", "source_sha256": "705c8dcfbb5ce927a6811cf8f92a1293dd9024271d27a655cb5a274e109452ab", "ja": "そんな事はない。昴の可愛さは、可愛い成分として\nもう昴自身から自然に出てるんだ！　何も心配するな！", "zh": "没这回事，昴的可爱是来自你身上自然散发的可爱因子！\n没什么好担心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1087_047sub", "source_sha256": "36c5867af54032e103307d2308c981be8908cb0ee0564e345d7971818b9ac721", "ja": "か、かわいい成分……！？", "zh": "可、可爱因子……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1088_p", "source_sha256": "d7cc61eca16bcbeb470dbf15118ec012c6820c4671b5e528b24e66ae97e40230", "ja": "だから大丈夫だ、昴。行ってこい！\n昴のステージを、ファンのみんなが待ってるんだから。", "zh": "所以没问题的，昴，快上场吧！\n粉丝都在期待你的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1089_047sub", "source_sha256": "66f862b4566c83d2def758985dcec8fb548adb632518e492fd7f8a9b39e4e1a5", "ja": "わ、わかったよ！\n……もう時間ないし、オレ、このまま行ってくる！", "zh": "我、我知道了！\n……没时间了，我就直接上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1090_p", "source_sha256": "bbfef6eb6ddc329c082dda7299a6dcef4e0caffd7ef40d7d1a13eb3fd927e894", "ja": "あっ、昴！", "zh": "啊，昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1091_047sub", "source_sha256": "d459263f5c27e1ea2157b40532f188debf2d061dc8ce48ce0765bb372d5cd710", "ja": "へ？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1092_p", "source_sha256": "e49137004e57e4955367867abbc69dcc227cfe3687924a35a11c42f6f8f706ba", "ja": "笑顔だ！　アイドルは、笑顔が一番だからな！\n笑って、ホームランを打ってこい！", "zh": "笑容！偶像最重要的就是笑容！\n笑一个，然后上去打支全垒打吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1093_047sub", "source_sha256": "7382c2690f39bf503df8b1767931266e39cfaa67a0b407d1f40267c06c3f84c9", "ja": "うん！　わかったよ、{$P$}！\nホームランか……へへっ。", "zh": "嗯！我知道了，{$P$}！\n全垒打啊……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1094_047sub", "source_sha256": "eef2f8a8476dd3866b9f8f28e634230e29c7658ef7f233981a2be2c3b2d47051", "ja": "９回裏ツーアウトだけど……\n逆転満塁ホームラン、決めてきてやるぜ！", "zh": "虽然现在是九局下半两出局……\n但我会用逆转满贯全垒打赢下比赛的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_038_1095_p", "source_sha256": "60d8c03acd3bfd5d04e254d0064203d8583eac88d599df1c25a7f6cf4e1f67bf", "ja": "（大丈夫だ。昴はありのままの笑顔が、一番眩しい。\n今日はきっと、最高のステージになるだろう！）", "zh": "（没问题的，昴自然的笑容就是最耀眼的。\n今天她一定能带来最棒的表演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
